<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Completar Cadastro</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="container">
        <%- include('partials/flash') %>

        <div class="login-box">
            <h1>Falta pouco!</h1>
            <p>O GitHub nem sempre informa seu nome completo. Confirme (ou corrija) abaixo pra concluir o cadastro.</p>

            <form action="/professor/completar-cadastro" method="POST">
                <input type="text" name="nome" placeholder="Nome completo" value="<%= nomeAtual %>" required>
                <button type="submit" class="btn">Confirmar</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
